if the object is put as a field of another object, then that object should not be scalar replaced.

We have to check if our code currently scalar replaces classes which have a static variable, aka only the other fields should be made as variables, static must be accessed directly from class.

objects passed to static variables cannot be scalar replaced (they have escaped)